repository-code: "https://github.com/ntunlplab/sustainable-veg"
abstract: >-
  Sustainable-VEG is a benchmark for fine-grained visual evidence grounding in
  sustainability reports. It provides page-level disclosure labels and
  region-level bounding boxes aligned with standardized SASB indicators.
keywords:
  - sustainability reports
  - ESG
  - visual evidence grounding
  - information extraction
  - document understanding
